<p>Summon an icy spike directly on a foe, impaling it for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> cold damage.</p><p>At level 5 it hits all foes in range 1 around the target.</p><p>Any creature hit will take <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30%</acronym> more damage from your necrotic minions for 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>